sequenceDiagram
    actor U as 사용자
    participant M as Milkdown
    participant H as useMarkdownPageEditor
    participant Q as Serialized Save Queue
    participant T as Tauri Page Command
    participant DB as SQLite

    U->>M: Markdown 편집
    M->>H: onChange(markdown)
    H->>H: debounce + contentHash 계산
    H->>Q: enqueue(pageId, baseRevision, markdown)
    Q->>T: save_page_v2
    T->>DB: BEGIN IMMEDIATE
    DB->>DB: revision 비교
    DB->>DB: pages UPSERT
    DB->>DB: page_versions INSERT
    DB->>DB: index_jobs INSERT
    DB-->>T: COMMIT + newRevision
    T-->>Q: SaveResult
    Q-->>H: 저장됨 / 충돌
    H-->>M: 저장 상태 표시
    Note over H,Q: 페이지 전환·날짜 변경·설정·내보내기·창 닫기 전 flushUnsaved()
